    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PLAYTEST NOTE: Post your high scores to our #playtesting channel on our discord!<br><br>Hunted to near extinction, with habitats in ruin, you must assemble the final flock to fight for all birdkind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Final Flock is an action-packed roguelite team builder. Your flock will follow you as you glide and weave through hordes of enemies to collect loot and resources. With satisfying controls and harrowing maneuvers, Final Flock will keep you flapping back for more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516180/extras/072e3af2358a32348f330ba8466ecade.poster.avif?t=1748441169\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516180/extras/072e3af2358a32348f330ba8466ecade.webm?t=1748441169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516180/extras/072e3af2358a32348f330ba8466ecade.mp4?t=1748441169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Final Flock will feature:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50 unique birds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 unique classes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascension levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent unlocks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game changing upgrades</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516180/extras/8dffe36751887f8898ff01e3dae09efb.poster.avif?t=1748441169\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516180/extras/8dffe36751887f8898ff01e3dae09efb.webm?t=1748441169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516180/extras/8dffe36751887f8898ff01e3dae09efb.mp4?t=1748441169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Final Flock is in development and we have lots more features planned! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516180/extras/e14e42210a7566cf798b30e16cd93e2e.poster.avif?t=1748441169\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516180/extras/e14e42210a7566cf798b30e16cd93e2e.webm?t=1748441169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516180/extras/e14e42210a7566cf798b30e16cd93e2e.mp4?t=1748441169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PLAYTEST NOTE: Post your high scores to our #playtesting channel on our discord!<br><br>Hunted to near extinction, with habitats in ruin, you must assemble the final flock to fight for all birdkind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Final Flock is an action-packed roguelite team builder. Your flock will follow you as you glide and weave through hordes of enemies to collect loot and resources. With satisfying controls and harrowing maneuvers, Final Flock will keep you flapping back for more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516180/extras/072e3af2358a32348f330ba8466ecade.poster.avif?t=1748441169\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516180/extras/072e3af2358a32348f330ba8466ecade.webm?t=1748441169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516180/extras/072e3af2358a32348f330ba8466ecade.mp4?t=1748441169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Final Flock will feature:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50 unique birds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 unique classes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascension levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permanent unlocks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game changing upgrades</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516180/extras/8dffe36751887f8898ff01e3dae09efb.poster.avif?t=1748441169\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516180/extras/8dffe36751887f8898ff01e3dae09efb.webm?t=1748441169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516180/extras/8dffe36751887f8898ff01e3dae09efb.mp4?t=1748441169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Final Flock is in development and we have lots more features planned! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516180/extras/e14e42210a7566cf798b30e16cd93e2e.poster.avif?t=1748441169\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516180/extras/e14e42210a7566cf798b30e16cd93e2e.webm?t=1748441169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516180/extras/e14e42210a7566cf798b30e16cd93e2e.mp4?t=1748441169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
